# Base URL for the backend API.
#
# LEAVE THIS UNSET for local dev, `vite preview` and the Vercel deployment.
# All three proxy `/api` to the backend server-to-server (vite.config.ts
# `server.proxy` / `preview.proxy`, and vercel.json `rewrites`), and the
# client calls its own origin — see src/lib/api/client.ts.
#
# That proxying is not a convenience: the API sends no CORS headers, so a
# browser cannot call it cross-origin. Setting this variable bypasses the
# proxy and points the client directly at the host, which only works if that
# host sends CORS headers. Setting it to the Render URL below will break
# every request from a deployed build.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
